# The hidden half stays out of git ON PURPOSE. This repo is public and it is the
# Pages site itself, so anything committed here is served: draft-src/data/hidden/
# would sit at haoming-chen2006.github.io/draft-src/data/hidden/nba.json and any
# drafter could read every card's numbers in a second tab, which is the one thing
# the whole game rests on not being possible.
#
# It is not a build problem — vite only emits what the app imports, and the app
# never imports it — purely a "committing source to a public site" problem. The
# judge Edge Function reads it at deploy time from the working copy.
data/hidden/

# Generated into the function bundle by `npm run sync`. The hidden half must never
# be committed — this repo is public and it is the website.
supabase/functions/judge/hidden/
